{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>For you shall take the seven ewes from my hand.</b> After the manner of ״שָׁלַף אִישׁ נַעֲלוֹ וְנָתַן לְרֵעֵהוּ וְזֹאת הַתְּעוּדָה״ (Ruth 4:7) — for this served as testimony to the agreement of the owners and their acknowledgment of the matter." "<b>So that it may be to me</b> the covenant <b>for a witness</b> to your acknowledgment <b>that I dug this well</b>."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:03.718717828Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}